{"ticker":"NRG","updated":"2026-10-23T23:23:14Z","profile":{"longName":"NRG Energy, Inc.","shortName":"NRG Energy, Inc.","sector":"Utilities","industry":"Utilities - Independent Power Producers","country":"United States","website":"https://www.nrg.com","fullTimeEmployees":16702,"marketCap":19404529664,"trailingPE":24.16492,"forwardPE":8.53573,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":0.58579713,"pegRatio":0.39,"targetMeanPrice":179.0,"targetHighPrice":270.0,"targetLowPrice":104.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":18,"recommendationKey":"strong_buy","revenueGrowth":0.11,"earningsGrowth":null,"grossMargins":0.18795,"operatingMargins":0.12765999,"profitMargins":0.02563,"totalRevenue":33124999168,"beta":1.161,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":189.96,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":90.8,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":2.01},"summary":"NRG Energy, Inc., together with its subsidiaries, operates as an energy and home services company in the United States and Canada. It operates through the Texas, East, West/Other, Vivint Smart Home, and Corporate Activities segments. The company offers retail electricity, energy management, demand response and virtual power plant programs, carbon offsets, smart home security, and automation services. It also offers system power, distributed and backup generation, energy storage, energy management, renewable and low-carbon products, and carbon management solutions for large business and commercial customers; a cloud-based home platform, including hardware, software, sales, installation, customer service, technical support, and professional monitoring solutions; and generation portfolio includes fossil fuel and renewable generation assets diversified by fuel type and dispatch level, with ongoing development of new natural gas and renewable projects. In addition, the company trades in power, natural gas, and related products; environmental products; weather products; and financial products, including forwards, futures, options, and swaps. It offers its products and services under the NRG, Reliant, Direct Energy, Green Mountain Energy, and Vivint. It serves residential, commercial, government, industrial, data center, and wholesale customers. NRG Energy, Inc. was founded in 1989 an","summary_zh":"NRG Energy, Inc. 及其子公司在美國和加拿大作為一家能源和家庭服務公司運營。該公司透過德克薩斯州、東部、西部/其他、Vivint 智慧家居和企業活動部門進行營運。該公司提供零售電力、能源管理、需求響應和虛擬發電廠計劃、碳抵消、智慧家庭安全和自動化服務。它還為大型企業和商業客戶提供系統電源、分散式和備用發電、能源儲存、能源管理、再生和低碳產品以及碳管理解決方案；基於雲端的家居平台，包括硬體、軟體、銷售、安裝、客戶服務、技術支援和專業監控解決方案；發電組合包括按燃料類型和調度水平多樣化的化石燃料和可再生發電資產，並不斷開發新的天然氣和可再生能源項目。此外，該公司還從事電力、天然氣及相關產品貿易；環保產品；天氣產品；以及金融產品，包括遠期、期貨、選擇權和掉期。它透過 NRG、Reliant、Direct Energy、Green Mountain Energy 和 Vivint 提供產品和服務。它為住宅、商業、政府、工業、資料中心和批發客戶提供服務。 NRG Energy, Inc. 成立於 1989 年","sector_zh":"公用事業","industry_zh":"公用事業 - 獨立電力生產商","candles":[{"t":"2025-08-25","o":145.74,"h":146.89,"l":144.28,"c":144.77,"v":2051300},{"t":"2025-08-26","o":145.0,"h":146.57,"l":143.82,"c":146.23,"v":2123400},{"t":"2025-08-27","o":146.74,"h":149.23,"l":146.37,"c":148.12,"v":1951300},{"t":"2025-08-28","o":147.93,"h":151.21,"l":147.46,"c":148.66,"v":1752100},{"t":"2025-08-29","o":148.17,"h":148.56,"l":143.96,"c":145.56,"v":1560800},{"t":"2025-09-02","o":142.27,"h":145.24,"l":140.77,"c":145.11,"v":2499300},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":144.89,"h":148.21,"l":144.19,"c":146.91,"v":1457700},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":148.02,"h":148.62,"l":146.17,"c":147.95,"v":1305000},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":148.95,"h":150.25,"l":142.87,"c":147.66,"v":1672700},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":148.73,"h":149.64,"l":144.79,"c":147.76,"v":2334000},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":148.5,"h":152.42,"l":147.82,"c":152.26,"v":1755800},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":154.95,"h":162.26,"l":154.91,"c":161.21,"v":3506700},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":161.46,"h":161.79,"l":157.75,"c":157.92,"v":2303200},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":157.7,"h":165.82,"l":157.02,"c":164.84,"v":2278800},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":165.11,"h":169.02,"l":165.11,"c":166.08,"v":2357700},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":166.62,"h":167.24,"l":162.25,"c":164.22,"v":2536200},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":165.38